    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAlthough I understand the premise, this is kind of tricky one to decide what is best. The current behavior is the same as if doing `p` after linewise yank. As this is the default behavior and is what I'd expect from multiply operation, that was kept as is.\r\n\r\nWhat I say for sure is that this won't be a behavior behind an option. I'll take some time to think if keeping cursor on the same relative position (column and, if it is even possible, line) is worth it.",
